<title>USA: Sytron's Dorado gets power plant order.</title>
<headline>Sytron's Dorado gets power plant order.</headline>
<dateline>BROOMFIELD, Colo. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sytron Inc said Monday its Dorado Systems Corp subsidiary was awarded an order for 115 card readers from SYSECA Inc, a subsidiary of Thomson-CSF's Information Technology Group.</p>
<p>The order, of undisclosed value, will be installed at Duke Power Co's three nuclear sites, Sytron said.</p>
<p>&quot;This order is the second in a series that could grow larger over time,&quot; the company commented.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
